class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1840880/extras/7c38de92a7f06110bc2667c3cc955297.poster.avif?t=1743461261\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1840880/extras/7c38de92a7f06110bc2667c3cc955297.webm?t=1743461261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1840880/extras/7c38de92a7f06110bc2667c3cc955297.mp4?t=1743461261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A cast of larger-than-life characters is dying to meet you</h2>Wait, aren't they already dead?.... No matter. Get to know each of them through hundreds of unique story events - and choose the one who'll escape the Purgatory with you. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1840880/extras/7504cfc66bb47569b5e6f030c8754d8e.poster.avif?t=1743461261\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1840880/extras/7504cfc66bb47569b5e6f030c8754d8e.webm?t=1743461261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1840880/extras/7504cfc66bb47569b5e6f030c8754d8e.mp4?t=1743461261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">More than a \u201cdate sim\u201d</h2>Finish side-quests and complete mini-games to win their rapport, then take your Lady of the Fleapit out on a date as the ultimate rewrd! <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1840880/extras/e10358efd67e449fe678d74c8625817e.poster.avif?t=1743461261\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1840880/extras/e10358efd67e449fe